argus (1.0.0-11) unstable; urgency=low

  * The package now installs the period and hourly views: chart-period.sh,
    chart-hourly.sh and argus-lib.sh under /opt/argus, and the commands
    argus-chart and argus-fetch in /usr/bin. chart-daily.sh and the
    collectors are untouched.
  * Manual pages argus(7), argus-chart(1) and argus-fetch(1), generated from
    man/<language>/ at build time, and the guides in /usr/share/doc/argus/.
  * The message at the end of the installation explains the two steps: the
    package on the server, argus-fetch on the desk.
